{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4189, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3944, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4194, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f2ddf0a5f0cff16881b8", "baseline_text": "아이리스，강하다구∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "アイリス、強いんだよ！", "pointer_offset": 3948, "unit": "dialogue:8214564f66baa022", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 5411, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f263f0b2f14881432f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf8e1f64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f15a8144", "baseline_text": "이 시합말이야，//아이리스의 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合はね、//アイリスのパイが//ボーナスパイになってるよ。", "pointer_offset": 3952, "unit": "dialogue:3e8bd67b0ec16b3c", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4278, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f1c881b82f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f15781432f2ff1e1f3c1f2658144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이거∈//이 중에서，어느 한 세트는，//맞춰줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこれ！//この中の、どれか１組は、//そろえてね。", "pointer_offset": 3956, "unit": "dialogue:5933575eca6e720d", "prior_review": "재검수2"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 5464, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f957f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf944f5f3f0c7f1488144", "baseline_text": "이번에는 아이리스가 딜러야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、アイリスが親だよ。", "pointer_offset": 3960, "unit": "dialogue:8e329e887655f05a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 5491, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0cff2c3f0f32f2ff0b5f3eef944f5f3f0c7f0f081b8", "baseline_text": "다음은//오빠가 딜러네∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次は//お兄ちゃんが親だね！", "pointer_offset": 3964, "unit": "dialogue:e443a19f623d3613", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4391, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f1d78160f0b28143f1d78160f0b281b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f0e2f2d5f0ae81b8", "baseline_text": "와～이，와～이∈//아이리스，대승리∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わ～い、わ～い！//アイリス、だいしょーりー！", "pointer_offset": 3968, "unit": "dialogue:cefff0fe9c983071", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4436, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b9f4bd81b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf8e1f64cf35f816081ac2f2ff0bcf0bcf14b816081b8", "baseline_text": "에엑∈//아이리스의 패배～〓//시시해～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "えーっ！//アイリスの負け～っ〓//つまんなーい∈", "pointer_offset": 3972, "unit": "dialogue:cfd59923170ef0ed", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4483, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f1d7f0af8143f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a81442f2ff9a9fa48fab8f0a5f0fa8143f0b5f3ee8144", "baseline_text": "와아，즐거웠어．//한 번 더 하자，오빠．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わーい、たのしかった。//もーいっかいやろ、お兄ちゃん。", "pointer_offset": 3976, "unit": "dialogue:536787886e653b89", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4538, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f0e2f9f7f26af0e2f15781432f2ff0a5f0b1f0c0f148816081442f2ff3a8f194f0a5f984f154f0c8f0f181b8", "baseline_text": "다음 대전 상대는，//하나비야～．//응원하고 있을게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の対戦相手は、//花火だよ～。//応援してるからね∈", "pointer_offset": 3980, "unit": "dialogue:5943dbce95b3319d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4589, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3984, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4612, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3988, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 5345, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f8d2f0bcf0ed816081b8", "baseline_text": "토너먼트 시작～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦のはじまり～！", "pointer_offset": 3992, "unit": "dialogue:75a600614e3fe66d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4660, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f26af0e2f957f263f0b2f148f7d12f2ff1f7fa938254f2aa81b8", "baseline_text": "상대는 말이야…//전부 ５명∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あいてはね……//ぜんぶで５人！", "pointer_offset": 3996, "unit": "dialogue:ab6301f9bfbcdc59", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4691, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0b5f3ee81b82f2ff0adf0a4f356f261f0a481432f2ff484f19c81b8", "baseline_text": "오빠∈//마지막까지，//힘내∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お兄ちゃん∈//さいごまで、//がんばってね！", "pointer_offset": 4000, "unit": "dialogue:23d5510c7d9c8edb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4734, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f0b5f3ee81b82f2ff9a9fa48f2b881432f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aafa82f0e2f2abf94bfa85f1c8f1488148", "baseline_text": "있잖아，오빠∈//한 번 더，//아이리스랑 대결해 줄 거야？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねぇ、お兄ちゃん！//もういっかい、//アイリスとたいせんしてくれる？", "pointer_offset": 4004, "unit": "dialogue:b4d5e175799ad50f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 5372, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f55ef0a5f3a481b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "꺄하핫∈//아이리스，지지 않을 거니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "キャハハ！//アイリスまけないからね！", "pointer_offset": 4008, "unit": "dialogue:e575f41e18a4dfd9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4838, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f0b981608143f0d8f1d4f0f9f957f1c8f148816081482f2ff0b5f3eef1572f2ff385f1f8f0b2f0a8f0b8f26181608144", "baseline_text": "에～，그만두는 거야～？//오빠는//겁쟁이라니까～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え～、やめちゃうの～？//お兄ちゃんの//いくじなし～。", "pointer_offset": 4012, "unit": "dialogue:c5699a66435fa1f2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0019", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4891, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f1d78160f0b28143f1d78160f0b281b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8143f0e2f2d5f0ae81b8", "baseline_text": "와～이，와～이∈//아이리스，대승리∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わ～い、わ～い！//アイリス、だいしょーりー！", "pointer_offset": 4016, "unit": "dialogue:cefff0fe9c983071", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN#0020", "file": "MINIGAME/JT04IRIS.SBN", "offset": 4936, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0b9f4bd81b82f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf8e1f64cf35f816081ac2f2ff0bcf0bcf14b816081b8", "baseline_text": "에엑∈//아이리스의 패배～〓//시시해～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "えーっ！//アイリスの負け～っ〓//つまんなーい∈", "pointer_offset": 4020, "unit": "dialogue:cfd59923170ef0ed", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
